// =============================================================================
// 99-reset-demo-data.kql : empty all tables, for example after the sample-data
// smoke test or before a customer demo. The schema and policies are kept.
//
// A table with OneLake availability turned on cannot be cleared. Turn OneLake
// availability off for the table first (database explorer, table details pane),
// run this script, then run 03-onelake-availability.kql again.
// =============================================================================

.execute database script <|
//
.clear table RawEvents data
.clear table TurbineTelemetry data
.clear table WeatherObservations data
.clear table AlarmEvents data
.clear table TurbineStateChanges data
.clear table AssetRegistry data
.clear table EdgeHeartbeats data
